        <body>
            <div xml:id="d181">

                <pb facs="0373" n="1333" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1333"/>

                <head>No. 894.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Roosevelt to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                                Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1888-10-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 11, 1888</date>. (Received
                        October 22.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 36.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In compliance with the instructions of your
                    No. 24, of September 28, I have the honor to inform you that after studying the
                    documents sent to me I addressed the inclosed communication to the minister of
                    foreign affairs, and am now awaiting his reply.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. B. Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d181-a1.xml" xpointer="d181-a1"/>
